  "features": [],
  "description_text": "Keep your phone secure and hands-free with these colorful silicone sticky pads featuring a built-in kickstand. The strong adhesive grip ensures your device stays in place, while the foldable stand lets you watch videos, take calls, or browse comfortably at any angle. Designed with a fun bubble-texture surface, these pads are available in a variety of stylish colors—cream, black, taupe, pink, lavender, mint green, coral orange, and navy blue. Lightweight, reusable, and easy to clean, they’re the perfect mix of function and style for everyday use.",
  "description_html": "<p>Keep your phone secure and hands-free with these colorful silicone sticky pads featuring a built-in kickstand. The strong adhesive grip ensures your device stays in place, while the foldable stand lets you watch videos, take calls, or browse comfortably at any angle. Designed with a fun bubble-texture surface, these pads are available in a variety of stylish colors—cream, black, taupe, pink, lavender, mint green, coral orange, and navy blue. Lightweight, reusable, and easy to clean, they’re the perfect mix of function and style for everyday use.</p>"
